// agent-tether bare layout.
//
// Zellij's tab-bar and status-bar are PLUGINS that the default layout loads
// into fixed-height panes. Not naming them here is what removes them; there is
// no separate "hide the UI" switch.
//
// The result is a single pane that behaves like an ordinary terminal, so:
//   - `zellij action dump-screen` returns the agent's output and nothing else
//   - an agent sending keystrokes never has to reason about zellij's modes
layout {
    pane
}
